ategorization.CategorizeSender.Description":"Click on #{moreButton} and look for #{categorizeButton} to categorize all current and future messages from a sender.","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Title":"About Categories","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Description":"Categories help you find the messages that matter most in Primary and organize everything else into Transactions, Updates, and Promotions. #{learnMore}","Categorization.OnboardingModal.LearnMore":"Learn More","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Primary.Heading":"Primary","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Primary.Description":"Stay focused on the people and subjects that matter most when messages are categorized as Primary.","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Transactions.Heading":"Transactions","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Transactions.Description":"Keep track of your purchases, including receipts and delivery updates, when you bundle messages by sender.","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Updates.Heading":"Updates","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Updates.Description":"Stay updated and organized with a place for every subscription, newsletter, and social media alert.","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Promotions.Heading":"Promotions","Categorization.OnboardingModal.Promotions.Description":"Browse special offers, events, and more from the businesses and organizations you might recognize.","Categorization.OnboardingModal.TimeSensitive.Heading":"Time-Sensitive Messages","Categorization.OnboardingModal.TimeSensitive.Description":"When a message in Transactions, Updates or Promotions includes time-sensitive information, it will also appear in Primary.","Categorization.RestoreCategoryRules.Confirmation.Title":"Reset Manual Categorization","Categorization.RestoreCategoryRules.Confirmation.Description":"Current and future messages from senders in this iCloud Mail account will be recategorized to the default setting.","Categorization.RestoreCategoryRules.Confirmation.Warning":"This change only applies to messages and catego