yout":"#{ConditionLabel}#{ConditionMenu}#{ConditionValue}#{ActionLabel}#{ActionMenu}#{ActionEmailInput}#{ActionChooseFolderMenu}","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Layout__comment":"This string represents the order in which UI is presented on screen. Each of the #{} blocks are UI, what follows is documentation of each. #{ConditionLabel}': 'String -> Rules.Form.Label.Condition', #{ConditionMenu}': 'Menu -> Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.*', #{ConditionValue}': 'TextInput -> PlaceholderText: Rules.Form.Placeholder.NameOrEmailAddress', #{Description}': 'String -> Rules.Form.Description (Not used in EN)', #{ActionLabel}': 'String -> Rules.Form.Label.Action', #{ActionMenu}': 'Menu -> Rules.RuleOptions.Action.*', #{ActionEmailInput}': 'TextInput -> PlaceholderText: Rules.Form.Placeholder.EmailAddress (Only shows if 'Forward' action chosen)', #{ActionChooseFolderMenu}': 'Menu -> PlaceholderText: Rules.Form.Placeholder.ChooseFolder (Only shows if 'Move' action chosen)'","Preferences.Rules.Form.Label.Condition":"Message","Preferences.Rules.Form.Label.Action":"Action","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.From":"is from","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.To":"is addressed to","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.Cc":"is Cc’d to","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.ToOrCc":"is addressed or Cc’d to","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.Subject":"has subject containing","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Condition.ListId":"has list-id containing","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.MoveToFolder":"Move to Folder","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.MoveToTrash":"Move to Trash","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.ForwardTo":"Forward to","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.MarkRead":"Mark as Read","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.MoveToFolderAndMarkRead":"Move to Folder and Mark as Read","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.MoveToTrashAndMarkRead":"Move to Trash and Mark as Read","Preferences.Rules.RuleOptions.Action.ForwardToAndMarkRead":"Forward to an E